                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3e23ff49-0d9d-4a5f-b480-402553dceedf",
                                                "sense_id": "c0406cdd-f798-38aa-8a99-611b2b0c9f29",
                                                "text": "She knew that she was the cause of her husband's utter ruin; and she strung herself to bear the consequences. The reproaches which agony extorted; or worse, cureless, uncomplaining depression, when his mind was sunk in a torpor, not the less painful because it was silent and moveless."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
